url: "https://github.com/RitAreaSciencePark/Protein_Crystallization_Data_Extraction"

abstract: 
  An automated computational pipeline that turn raw PDB metadata into structure, FAIR compliant datasets. 
  It accepts a protein sequence as input, retrieves all related PDB structures via the RCSB API, extracts 
  and filters crystallization condition metadata, annotates entries with chemical compound information,
  outputs analysis ready CSV, pdf, and high-resolution figures. 
  
